0 FILE 6932 - Stardefender 200.ldr
0 A Futuron-era starship comprising a central command spaceship with cockpit, twin cargo containers with hinged doors, side wings, a laser cannon turret, a wheeled ground vehicle, and two space-suited minifigures.
0 Name: 6932 - Stardefender 200.ldr
0 Author: Damien Roux [Darats]
